msgid "The Avalanche"
msgstr "De Lawine"

#: game/content/jokers.gd:95
msgid "Every other Joker's scoring effect triggers twice (Chips and Mult add twice, xMult applies twice)."
msgstr "Het score-effect van elke andere Joker werkt twee keer (chips en Mult tellen dubbel, xMult werkt dubbel)."

